  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Continental Green Financing Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed operation consists of a senior unsecured loan to Banco Continental for an amount of up to US$100 million, that contemplates: (i) a Committed Tranche I: which consists of an A Loan of upto US$50 million; (ii) an Uncommitted Tranche II: consisting of an A Loan of up to US$50 million; and (iii) the operation contemplates the possibility of mobilizing resources from institutional investors through a B Loan for an amount to be determined in accordance with market conditions. The operation will have a term of up to five years, with up to two years of grace period. The funds from the operation will be used to finance the growth of Banco Continental&apos;s green portfolio in Paraguay.</narrative>
  </description>
